  "solution": "Given equation: 79 ÷ 11 (6 > 3) + 9\n\n \n \n\n \n \n**Symbol**\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n**Meaning**\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n\nAfter replacing the symbols by their meaning, we get:\n\n79 + 11 × 18 ÷ **__(6 __****__÷__****__ 3)__** - 9\n\n= 79 + 11 × **__18 __****__÷ 2__** - 9\n\n= 79 +** __11 __**__**× 9**__ - 9\n\n= __**79 + 99**__ - 9\n\n= 178 - 9\n\n= 169\n\nHence, '**169**' is the correct answer.",
